 "training_env": {
  "reading": [
   {
    "point": "share of distillation ticks with an exactly zero twist command",
    "source": "standing envs get the whole command zeroed (mjlab velocity_command.py:84, :136); the share is the standing_envs curriculum's last stage 0.25 (src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_velocity_env_cfg.py:798-804), reached at once because build_env sets the step counter past every stage (cmu/finetune/flight/distill_worker.py:59); 15 % of envs are turn-in-place and are taken out of the standing set (microduck_velocity_env_cfg.py:25, mdp.py:4771). Expected 0.25 x 0.85 = 0.21 of command draws",
    "measured": "training_env.as_distilled: zero_twist_tick_fraction over the first 400 ticks of a fresh env (a lower bound: the curriculum value applies from an env's first resample) and resets_starting_at_zero_twist_fraction"
   },
   {
    "point": "does an episode begin at zero command from reset with an empty student state",
    "source": "yes: the command is redrawn at reset and the student's state is zeroed for the reset envs (distill_worker.py:230); about one reset in five starts at zero command (measured share above)"
   },
